+- [ ] Existing scalar/bulk generated obligation suites with composition off/on and both receipt layouts.
+- [ ] Counterbalanced frozen native-mail benchmark, separately and composed with the attempt-lookup optimization.
+- [ ] Required CI and exact-head report inspection.
